  <section class="light rounded-b-[40px] min-h-[60vh] flex items-center"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 py-20"><p class="eyebrow">404</p><h1 class="display-xl mt-3">Nothing to see here.</h1><p class="mt-4 text-plum/80 max-w-md">That page doesn't exist. Your skin, however, deserves a look.</p><div class="mt-7 flex gap-3 flex-wrap"><a href="/" class="btn btn-plum">Home</a><a href="/book" class="btn btn-tang">Book a treatment</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
